    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1586">

                <pb facs="1328" n="1224" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1224"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 723.2515/272.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to Chile to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 11, 1912</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Minister for Foreign Affairs has given out statement to the effect that an
                    agreement has been effected by telegraph with Peru to reestablish diplomatic
                    relations and fixing precise terms of settlement <pb facs="1329" n="1225"
                        xml:id="pg1225"/> of the Tacna Arica question. Council of State will be held
                    today and if they approve the bases of settlement will be submitted to Congress
                    at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
